{"id":125,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"仏教教育と一貫教育で育つ国府台女子学院","feature_description":"国府台女子学院は、仏教を基にした教育と小中高12年の女子一貫教育を柱に掲げています。中学部では仏教や倫理的な課題を通して生き方を考え、1年で学習・生活習慣、2年で主体的な課題解決、3年で応用・実践力を育てます。英語の少人数授業や外部検定、担任と日々やりとりする生活記録も取り入れています。生徒の将来を見据えた基礎づくりが中学3年間の目標です。","clubs":[{"id":2692,"name":"園芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2693,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2694,"name":"文学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2695,"name":"仏教研究会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2696,"name":"クッキング部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2697,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2698,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2699,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2700,"name":"創作絵本部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2701,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2702,"name":"映画部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2703,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konodai-gs.ac.jp/senior/sn_life/sn_club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2704,"name":"ギター部","categor